      "description": "<p>You may perform an action and spend 10 MP to lock onto a target. During the next turn, any action performed by an ally against this target gains a <strong>+2 bonus</strong> to associated Checks.</p>\n<p>If all performed Checks against the target during this time are successful, the target also suffers \n  <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\">\n    <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.KYehgac3Pw1fKC9S\" data-id=\"KYehgac3Pw1fKC9S\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;cursor:pointer;--content-link-background:rgba(0,0,0,.1);background-image:none!important;padding:0;border:none;border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap;color:inherit;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;position:relative;top:2px;\">\n      <strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Weak</span></strong>\n    </a>\n  </span></span>.\n</p>\n<p>If the target is reduced to 0 Hit Points (HP) while under the effect of this Skill, you may immediately mark another target at no additional MP cost.</p>\n",
